      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Substitute $x = 2.0001$ into the function $f(x)$:\n$$k = f(2.0001) = (2(2.0001) - 1)\\sqrt{3(2.0001) - 2} - 2$$",
        "Evaluate the intermediate values:\n$$2(2.0001) - 1 = 3.0002, \\quad 3(2.0001) - 2 = 4.0003$$\n$$\\sqrt{4.0003} \\approx 2.000074998...$$",
